{"seq":4,"slug":"nuxt-deployment","title":"Nuxt 部署","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/routing-and-ssr/nuxt-deployment","wordCount":613,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"nuxt-部署\">Nuxt 部署</h1><h2 id=\"渲染模式\">渲染模式</h2><p>Nuxt 3 支持多种渲染模式，可以根据应用需求灵活选择：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    App[&quot;Nuxt 应用&quot;]&#10;    App --&gt; SSR[&quot;SSR&lt;br/&gt;服务端渲染&quot;]&#10;    App --&gt; SSG[&quot;SSG&lt;br/&gt;静态生成&quot;]&#10;    App --&gt; ISR[&quot;ISR&lt;br/&gt;增量静态再生&quot;]&#10;    App --&gt; SPA[&quot;SPA&lt;br/&gt;纯客户端&quot;]&#10;    App --&gt; Hybrid[&quot;Hybrid&lt;br/&gt;混合渲染&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    App[\"Nuxt 应用\"]\n    App --&gt; SSR[\"SSR&lt;br/&gt;服务端渲染\"]\n    App --&gt; SSG[\"SSG&lt;br/&gt;静态生成\"]\n    App --&gt; ISR[\"ISR&lt;br/&gt;增量静态再生\"]\n    App --&gt; SPA[\"SPA&lt;br/&gt;纯客户端\"]\n    App --&gt; Hybrid[\"Hybrid&lt;br/&gt;混合渲染\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th align=\"center\">首屏速度</th>\n<th align=\"center\">SEO</th>\n<th align=\"center\">服务器需求</th>\n<th align=\"center\">数据实时性</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SSR</td>\n<td align=\"center\">⚡快</td>\n<td align=\"center\">✅</td>\n<td align=\"center\">需要</td>\n<td align=\"center\">实时</td>\n<td>动态内容网站</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SSG</td>\n<td align=\"center\">⚡⚡极快</td>\n<td align=\"center\">✅</td>\n<td align=\"center\">不需要</td>\n<td align=\"center\">构建时</td>\n<td>博客、文档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ISR</td>\n<td align=\"center\">⚡快</td>\n<td align=\"center\">✅</td>\n<td align=\"center\">需要</td>\n<td align=\"center\">定时更新</td>\n<td>电商、新闻</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SPA</td>\n<td align=\"center\">较慢</td>\n<td align=\"center\">❌</td>\n<td align=\"center\">不需要</td>\n<td align=\"center\">实时</td>\n<td>管理后台</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>渲染模式</strong>：SSR 每次请求服务端渲染、SSG 构建时预渲染、ISR 在两者之间按时间重新生成、SPA 纯客户端渲染，取舍在于首屏速度、SEO 与服务器成本。</li>\n<li><strong>混合渲染</strong>：<code>routeRules</code> 允许按路由分别指定策略，例如首页预渲染、后台 CSR、API 开启 CORS。</li>\n<li><strong>Nitro</strong>：Nuxt 的服务端引擎，通过 preset 把同一份产物部署到 Node、Vercel、Cloudflare、AWS 等平台。</li>\n<li><strong>Edge Rendering</strong>：把服务端逻辑下沉到 CDN 边缘节点，降低全球用户的访问延迟，代价是运行时受限。</li>\n<li><strong>构建产物</strong>：<code>.output</code> 是部署单元，Docker 多阶段构建最终只保留它。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"ssr-服务端渲染\">SSR（服务端渲染）</h2><p>每次请求时在服务端渲染 HTML，适合需要 SEO 和动态内容的场景：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// nuxt.config.ts&#10;export default defineNuxtConfig({&#10;  ssr: true,&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// nuxt.config.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineNuxtConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ssr: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant B as 浏览器&#10;    participant S as Nuxt Server&#10;    participant DB as 数据源&#10;&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;S: GET /products&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;DB: 获取商品数据&#10;    DB--&gt;&gt;S: 返回数据&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;S: 渲染 Vue 组件为 HTML&#10;    S--&gt;&gt;B: 返回完整 HTML + JS&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;B: Hydration(激活交互)\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant B as 浏览器\n    participant S as Nuxt Server\n    participant DB as 数据源\n\n    B-&gt;&gt;S: GET /products\n    S-&gt;&gt;DB: 获取商品数据\n    DB--&gt;&gt;S: 返回数据\n    S-&gt;&gt;S: 渲染 Vue 组件为 HTML\n    S--&gt;&gt;B: 返回完整 HTML + JS\n    B-&gt;&gt;B: Hydration(激活交互)</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"ssg-静态站点生成\">SSG（静态站点生成）</h2><p>构建时预渲染所有页面为静态 HTML：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// nuxt.config.ts&#10;export default defineNuxtConfig({&#10;  // 使用 npx nuxi generate 命令&#10;  nitro: {&#10;    prerender: {&#10;      routes: [&#39;/&#39;],&#10;      crawlLinks: true,&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// nuxt.config.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineNuxtConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 使用 npx nuxi generate 命令</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  nitro: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    prerender: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      routes: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      crawlLinks: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 生成静态站点&#10;npx nuxi generate&#10;&#10;# 输出到 .output/public/&#10;# 可直接部署到任何静态托管服务\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 生成静态站点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nuxi</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> generate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 输出到 .output/public/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 可直接部署到任何静态托管服务</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"isr-增量静态再生\">ISR（增量静态再生）</h2><p>结合 SSG 的速度和 SSR 的实时性，页面在一定时间后重新生成：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// nuxt.config.ts&#10;export default defineNuxtConfig({&#10;  routeRules: {&#10;    &#39;/&#39;: { prerender: true },&#10;    &#39;/blog/**&#39;: { isr: 3600 },&#10;    &#39;/products/**&#39;: { isr: 600 },&#10;    &#39;/admin/**&#39;: { ssr: false },&#10;    &#39;/api/**&#39;: { cors: true },&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// nuxt.config.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineNuxtConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  routeRules: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '/'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { prerender: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '/blog/**'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { isr: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3600</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '/products/**'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { isr: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">600</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '/admin/**'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { ssr: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '/api/**'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { cors: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    R[&quot;用户请求 /blog/xxx&quot;]&#10;    R --&gt; C{&quot;缓存有效?&quot;}&#10;    C -- &quot;是(&lt; 1小时)&quot; --&gt; Cache[&quot;返回缓存页面&quot;]&#10;    C -- &quot;否(&gt; 1小时)&quot; --&gt; Regen[&quot;后台重新生成&quot;]&#10;    Regen --&gt; NC[&quot;更新缓存&quot;]&#10;    NC --&gt; Cache2[&quot;下次请求返回新页面&quot;]&#10;    C -- &quot;首次请求&quot; --&gt; SSR[&quot;SSR 渲染&quot;]&#10;    SSR --&gt; SC[&quot;写入缓存&quot;]&#10;    SC --&gt; Return[&quot;返回页面&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    R[\"用户请求 /blog/xxx\"]\n    R --&gt; C{\"缓存有效?\"}\n    C -- \"是(&lt; 1小时)\" --&gt; Cache[\"返回缓存页面\"]\n    C -- \"否(&gt; 1小时)\" --&gt; Regen[\"后台重新生成\"]\n    Regen --&gt; NC[\"更新缓存\"]\n    NC --&gt; Cache2[\"下次请求返回新页面\"]\n    C -- \"首次请求\" --&gt; SSR[\"SSR 渲染\"]\n    SSR --&gt; SC[\"写入缓存\"]\n    SC --&gt; Return[\"返回页面\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"nitro-引擎\">Nitro 引擎</h2><p>Nitro 是 Nuxt 3 的服务器引擎，支持跨平台部署：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// nuxt.config.ts&#10;export default defineNuxtConfig({&#10;  nitro: {&#10;    preset: &#39;node-server&#39;,&#10;    compressPublicAssets: true,&#10;    minify: true,&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// nuxt.config.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineNuxtConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  nitro: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    preset: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'node-server'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    compressPublicAssets: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    minify: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Preset</th>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>node-server</code></td>\n<td>Node.js</td>\n<td>传统服务器部署</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>vercel</code></td>\n<td>Vercel</td>\n<td>Serverless Functions</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cloudflare-pages</code></td>\n<td>Cloudflare</td>\n<td>Edge Workers</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>netlify</code></td>\n<td>Netlify</td>\n<td>Serverless</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>aws-lambda</code></td>\n<td>AWS</td>\n<td>Lambda Functions</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>deno-server</code></td>\n<td>Deno</td>\n<td>Deno Deploy</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>bun</code></td>\n<td>Bun</td>\n<td>Bun 运行时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>static</code></td>\n<td>任意</td>\n<td>静态站点（SSG）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"vercel-部署\">Vercel 部署</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// nuxt.config.ts&#10;export default defineNuxtConfig({&#10;  nitro: {&#10;    preset: &#39;vercel&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// nuxt.config.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineNuxtConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  nitro: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    preset: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'vercel'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"// vercel.json（可选）&#10;{&#10;  &quot;buildCommand&quot;: &quot;npx nuxi build&quot;,&#10;  &quot;outputDirectory&quot;: &quot;.output&quot;,&#10;  &quot;framework&quot;: &quot;nuxtjs&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// vercel.json（可选）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"buildCommand\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"npx nuxi build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"outputDirectory\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\".output\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"framework\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"nuxtjs\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"cloudflare-部署\">Cloudflare 部署</h2><h3 id=\"cloudflare-pages\">Cloudflare Pages</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// nuxt.config.ts&#10;export default defineNuxtConfig({&#10;  nitro: {&#10;    preset: &#39;cloudflare-pages&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// nuxt.config.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineNuxtConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  nitro: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    preset: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cloudflare-pages'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"edge-rendering\">Edge Rendering</h3><p>边缘渲染将服务端逻辑部署到全球 CDN 边缘节点，显著降低延迟：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Traditional[&quot;传统 SSR&quot;]&#10;        U1[&quot;用户(亚洲)&quot;] --&gt; |&quot;高延迟&quot;| S1[&quot;服务器(美国)&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Edge[&quot;Edge Rendering&quot;]&#10;        U2[&quot;用户(亚洲)&quot;] --&gt; |&quot;低延迟&quot;| E1[&quot;边缘节点(亚洲)&quot;]&#10;        U3[&quot;用户(欧洲)&quot;] --&gt; |&quot;低延迟&quot;| E2[&quot;边缘节点(欧洲)&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Traditional[\"传统 SSR\"]\n        U1[\"用户(亚洲)\"] --&gt; |\"高延迟\"| S1[\"服务器(美国)\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Edge[\"Edge Rendering\"]\n        U2[\"用户(亚洲)\"] --&gt; |\"低延迟\"| E1[\"边缘节点(亚洲)\"]\n        U3[\"用户(欧洲)\"] --&gt; |\"低延迟\"| E2[\"边缘节点(欧洲)\"]\n    end</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Edge Runtime 有一些限制：不支持 Node.js 原生模块（如 <code>fs</code>、<code>path</code>），需要使用 Web API 兼容的库。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"docker-部署\">Docker 部署</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dockerfile\" data-code=\"FROM node:20-alpine AS builder&#10;WORKDIR /app&#10;COPY package*.json ./&#10;RUN npm ci&#10;COPY . .&#10;RUN npx nuxi build&#10;&#10;FROM node:20-alpine AS runner&#10;WORKDIR /app&#10;COPY --from=builder /app/.output .output&#10;ENV HOST=0.0.0.0&#10;ENV PORT=3000&#10;EXPOSE 3000&#10;CMD [&quot;node&quot;, &quot;.output/server/index.mjs&quot;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>FROM node:20-alpine AS builder</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WORKDIR /app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>COPY package*.json ./</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RUN npm ci</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>COPY . .</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RUN npx nuxi build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>FROM node:20-alpine AS runner</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WORKDIR /app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>COPY --from=builder /app/.output .output</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ENV HOST=0.0.0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ENV PORT=3000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>EXPOSE 3000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CMD [\"node\", \".output/server/index.mjs\"]</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"构建产物分析\">构建产物分析</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// nuxt.config.ts&#10;export default defineNuxtConfig({&#10;  build: {&#10;    analyze: true,&#10;  },&#10;  vite: {&#10;    build: {&#10;      rollupOptions: {&#10;        output: {&#10;          manualChunks: {&#10;            &#39;vendor-vue&#39;: [&#39;vue&#39;, &#39;vue-router&#39;],&#10;            &#39;vendor-pinia&#39;: [&#39;pinia&#39;],&#10;          },&#10;        },&#10;      },&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// nuxt.config.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineNuxtConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  build: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    analyze: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  vite: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    build: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      rollupOptions: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        output: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          manualChunks: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            'vendor-vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'vue-router'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            'vendor-pinia'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pinia'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Nuxt 3 支持 <strong>SSR</strong>、<strong>SSG</strong>、<strong>ISR</strong>、<strong>SPA</strong> 和<strong>混合渲染</strong>模式</li>\n<li><code>routeRules</code> 允许为不同路由配置不同的渲染策略</li>\n<li><strong>Nitro 引擎</strong>通过 preset 支持跨平台部署：Vercel、Cloudflare、AWS、Docker 等</li>\n<li><strong>ISR</strong> 结合静态生成速度与服务端渲染的数据实时性，适合内容类网站</li>\n<li><strong>Edge Rendering</strong> 将渲染逻辑部署到边缘节点，大幅降低全球用户的访问延迟</li>\n<li>Docker 部署使用多阶段构建，最终镜像仅包含 <code>.output</code> 产物</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Nuxt 部署","id":"nuxt-部署"},{"level":2,"text":"渲染模式","id":"渲染模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"SSR（服务端渲染）","id":"ssr-服务端渲染"},{"level":2,"text":"SSG（静态站点生成）","id":"ssg-静态站点生成"},{"level":2,"text":"ISR（增量静态再生）","id":"isr-增量静态再生"},{"level":2,"text":"Nitro 引擎","id":"nitro-引擎"},{"level":2,"text":"Vercel 部署","id":"vercel-部署"},{"level":2,"text":"Cloudflare 部署","id":"cloudflare-部署"},{"level":3,"text":"Cloudflare Pages","id":"cloudflare-pages"},{"level":3,"text":"Edge Rendering","id":"edge-rendering"},{"level":2,"text":"Docker 部署","id":"docker-部署"},{"level":2,"text":"构建产物分析","id":"构建产物分析"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Nuxt 数据获取","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/routing-and-ssr/nuxt-data-fetching"},"next":{"title":"Vite 集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/ecosystem-and-patterns/vite-integration"}}